	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Primarily eschewing commercially prepared stones, naturally sourced stones are used. The variety of shapes and textures is conducive to diversity of sensation, and some of the rougher stones perform a gentle exfoliation.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">No stones or equipment is reused between clients without being subjected to a deep clean.</p>
